# What the 3x3 rooms sample's README commands write inside the sample folder:
# the room pack, the linked maps, and the flattened reference and its
# compile's outputs; and what the commands write by default, beside the
# library and the level files.
samples/rooms-3x3/out/
samples/rooms-3x3/maps/
samples/rooms-3x3/*.roompack
samples/rooms-3x3/levels/*.bsp
samples/rooms-3x3/levels/*.vmf
# Compile output beside the corpus maps: maps/ is test corpus, and a compile
# run in place (ssmap all maps/ss_sandbox.vmf) writes these next to the .vmf.
maps/*.bsp
maps/*.prt
maps/*.log
maps/*.lin
